Z","body":"## Version differences\r\n\r\n### Android\r\n* For Android version 11 and higher, you need to use .apk that start with - AmneziaVPN_5.1.0.6_android11+\r\n* For Android version 9-10, you need to use .apk that start with - AmneziaVPN_5.1.0.6_android9-10\r\n* ***The app version for Android 7 and 8 is temporarily unavailable***\r\n\r\n### macOS\r\n!!! The previous version (4.8.8.2 and lower) of the application (installed via the .dmg installer) must be uninstalled via “move to bin” in the applications folder\r\n\r\n* For macOS version 13 and higher, you need to use .pkg - AmneziaVPN_5.1.0.6_macos.pkg\r\n* ***The app version for macOS 10.15 - 12, is temporarily unavailable***\r\n\r\n### Linux\r\nFor Ubuntu you need to install xcb plugin:\r\napt install libxcb-cursor0 libxcb-xinerama0 libxcb-icccm4 libxcb-keysyms1 libopengl0 libxkbcommon-x11-0\r\n\r\n## Changelog\r\n\r\n### General\r\n* Improve stability\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/amnezia-vpn/amnezia-client/compare/5.0.3.0...5.1.0.6","is_prerelease":false},"readme":true,"readme_zh":false,"news":[],"stale":false,"snapshot_at":"2026-11-14T08:50:43Z","history_start":"2026-09-06"}